### HawaCommand AI-ML Engine Serving API Test Requests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Digital Twin Vector Heatmap
GET {{baseUrl}}/twin?limit=50
Accept: application/json

### 3. 72-Hour Quantile Forecast & GRAP Outlook
GET {{baseUrl}}/forecast/G-052-054?pm25=245.0
Accept: application/json

### 4. Ranked Hotspots by Human Exposure
GET {{baseUrl}}/hotspots?ward=all&limit=8&hour=8
Accept: application/json

### 5. Draft Exposure-First Dispatch Plan
POST {{baseUrl}}/plans/draft
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ward": "all",
  "limit_hotspots": 5,
  "shift_hours": 4.0,
  "assets": [
    {
      "id": "SPR-04",
      "type": "sprinkler",
      "depot_lat": 28.6476,
      "depot_lon": 77.3000,
      "capacity_litres": 10000
    },
    {
      "id": "INSP-01",
      "type": "inspection_team",
      "depot_lat": 28.6139,
      "depot_lon": 77.2090,
      "capacity_litres": 0
    }
  ]
}

### 6. What-If Plan Simulation vs Baseline
POST {{baseUrl}}/plans/PLAN-20261112-06/simulate
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 7. Causal Impact Verification
POST {{baseUrl}}/interventions/INT-20261112-01/verify
Content-Type: application/json

### 8. Proactive Operational Insights & Bilingual Narratives
GET {{baseUrl}}/insights
Accept: application/json

### 9. Telemetry Packet Ingest (Proposal §10.6 format)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingest/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "v": 1,
  "dev": "HPM-1002",
  "role": "M",
  "seq": 1042,
  "ts": "2026-11-12T06:15:00Z",
  "gps": {
    "lat": 28.6331,
    "lon": 77.2194,
    "spd": 22.4,
    "hdop": 0.9
  },
  "pm": {
    "pm1": 95.0,
    "pm25": 165.0,
    "pm10": 260.0
  },
  "gas": {
    "no2_ppb": 42.0,
    "co_ppb": 1350.0,
